      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. what about the smaller, local connections? like once i get off the main lines in osaka or fukuoka, i'll have to deal with local buses or subways to get to my actual hotels. i've heard those can be a bit of a maze and easy to get lost in. any tips for staying on track with those local transit pieces so i don't waste time wandering around?",
